<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>You left something behind</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.75em 1.5em;
            background-color: #0143f7;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .warning { color: #cc0000; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Did you forget something? 🛒</h2>

    <p>Hi {{ user.getFirstName() }},</p>

    <p>We noticed you have items in your cart waiting for you.</p>

    <p>Don't miss out - your items are still available. Complete your order before they're gone.</p>

    <p class="warning">
        ⚠️ Reminder: your cart will be automatically deleted in {{ daysRemaining }} day{{ daysRemaining != 1 ? 's' : '' }}.
    </p>

    <p>
        <a href="{{ cartUrl }}" class="button" style="color: #fff;">View My Cart →</a>
    </p>

    <p>If you changed your mind, you don't need to do anything.</p>

    <p>
        Thanks,<br>
        LevelUp Store
    </p>
</body>
</html>
